  "solution_ref": "(i) $b=1$: $a>2$ → $(3,1),(4,1),(5,1)$. (ii) $b=2$: $a=1$ → $(1,2)$. (iii) $b=3$: $-a+3<1$, $a>2$ → $(3,3),(4,3),(5,3)$. (iv) $b=4$: $1<-a+4<3$ → $(2,4)$. (v) $b=5$: $2<a<4$ → $(3,5)$. $M=8$, $m=3$, $Mm=24$",
